{
  "version": 1,
  "units": "logical px (PNG files are rendered at pngScale x this size)",
  "pngScale": 2,
  "angles": {
    "unit": "degrees",
    "positive": "clockwise on screen (y axis down)",
    "zero": "pointing right (tank faces right; mirror the root for left)",
    "up": "-90 = straight up"
  },
  "notes": [
    "Every node's 'position' is where its pivot sits, measured from the PARENT's pivot, before the parent's rotation.",
    "'pivot' is the pixel point inside the sprite that is the joint (rotation center), in logical px.",
    "'z' orders siblings only (higher = in front). Children render with their parent.",
    "To face left, mirror the whole tank root horizontally (scale.x = -1).",
    "Tank Y origin = hull pivot (bottom centre of the hull). groundContacts are relative to it."
  ],
